# Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored here, unlike in the root `fuzz/`
# directory. This is its own cargo workspace, so no Dependabot entry reaches
# it; tracking the lockfile is what makes divergence from the workspace
# detectable at all. `just check-fuzz-lock-parity` gates it on every PR — see
# README.md and docs/ADR/0011-fuzz-lockfile-workspace-parity.md.
